FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaIntro::
    .string "Fwahahaha!\p"
    .string "A mere child like you dares to\n"
    .string "challenge me?\p"
    .string "The very idea makes me shiver with\n"
    .string "mirth!\p"
    .string "Very well, I shall show you true\n"
    .string "terror as a ninja master.\p"
    .string "Poison brings steady doom. Sleep\n"
    .string "renders foes helpless.\p"
    .string "Despair to the creeping horror of\n"
    .string "Poison-type Pokémon!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_RulesExplain::
    .string "However, numbers mean nothing to a\n"
    .string "ninja.\p"
    .string "The rules grant us three. A pity.\n"
    .string "A master would need but one.\p"
    .string "Eliminate the unnecessary.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you wish to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your party?$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaReady::
    .string "So, you have prepared yourself.\p"
    .string "Then face the deadly art of the\n"
    .string "Poison-type!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_Refused::
    .string "Fwahahaha!\n"
    .string "Are you fleeing from the shadows?\p"
    .string "Return when you have exactly three\n"
    .string "Pokémon.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_StillNot3::
    .string "You still do not have exactly three\n"
    .string "Pokémon.\p"
    .string "A ninja must be precise. Do not waste\n"
    .string "my time.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaDefeat::
    .string "Humph! You have proven your worth!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery1::
    .string "Here, take the Soul Badge!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery2::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}{PLAYER} received the Soul Badge\n"
    .string "from Koga!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_BadgeDelivery3::
    .string "Now that you have the Soul Badge,\n"
    .string "the Defense of your Pokémon rises.\p"
    .string "It also lets you Surf outside of\n"
    .string "battle.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisWithYou::
    .string "Ah!\n"
    .string "Take this, too!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM06FromKoga::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM06\n"
    .string "from Koga.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaExplainTM06::
    .string "Sealed within that TM06 lies Toxic!\p"
    .string "It is a secret technique dating back\n"
    .string "some four hundred years.\p"
    .string "When afflicted by Toxic, a Pokémon\n"
    .string "suffers more and more.\p"
    .string "It suffers worsening damage as the\n"
    .string "battle wears on!\p"
    .string "It will surely terrorize foes!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaPostBattle::
    .string "You have survived the toxic trap.\p"
    .string "Remember to always mind your\n"
    .string "surroundings.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaRematchIntro::
    .string "So. The Champion returns.\p"
    .string "Stronger, yes. But still so very loud\n"
    .string "I heard you the moment you set\l"
    .string "foot in Fuchsia.\p"
    .string "A true ninja moves as silence itself.\n"
    .string "You have much to unlearn.\p"
    .string "I'm willing to tutor you once again\n"
    .string "if you're inclined to truly learn.\p"
    .string "Then let your first lesson begin.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaRematchRules::
    .string "Any novice can strike alone. The\n"
    .string "shadows demand nothing of them.\p"
    .string "But to move as two, as one mind…\n"
    .string "That is the harder art.\p"
    .string "We shall fight two against two. Bring\n"
    .string "four, and prove you can.\p"
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you wish to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to organize your party?$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaRematchReady::
    .string "Your pair is chosen. Now still your\n"
    .string "breath, and begin.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_RefusedRematch::
    .string "You withdraw. Good.\p"
    .string "Knowing when to strike is a sign of\n"
    .string "wisdom.\p"
    .string "Return when the moment is yours.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_StillNot4::
    .string "Numbers alone do not work here, nor\n"
    .string "do they replace precision.\p"
    .string "Bring exactly four Pokémon.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaRematchDefeat::
    .string "…\n"
    .string "I did not hear the final blow.\p"
    .string "It means you have learned. I am\n"
    .string "satisfied.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaRematchBeforeReward::
    .string "A pupil who bests the master deserves\n"
    .string "a master's secret. Take this.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaRematchAfterReward::
    .string "A true ninja does not die when death\n"
    .string "is certain.\p"
    .string "With this, when a fatal blow would\n"
    .string "fall, one breath of life remains.\p"
    .string "Outwit death itself, Champion.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaRematchPostBattle::
    .string "You came to me loud, and leave in\n"
    .string "silence.\p"
    .string "Surely you have become something\n"
    .string "more.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KogaPostRematch::
    .string "Bear in mind that a true master never\n"
    .string "stops learning, Champion.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_MakeSpaceForThis::
    .string "Make space for this, child!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_RematchNotEnoughPlaceholder::
    .string "$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_OfferPCRetrieve::
    .string "{COLOR DARK_GRAY}Do you want to open the Storage\n"
    .string "System to retrieve your team?$"

@Last line related to Koga

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KaydenIntro::
    .string "Strength isn't the key for Pokémon.\n"
    .string "Do you understand this?\p"
    .string "Pokémon is about strategy!\p"
    .string "I'll show you how strategy can\n"
    .string "beat brute strength.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KaydenDefeat::
    .string "What?\n"
    .string "Extraordinary!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KaydenPostBattle::
    .string "So, you mix brawn with brains?\n"
    .string "Good strategy!\p"
    .string "That's remarkable for a child\n"
    .string "Trainer.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KirkIntro::
    .string "I was a magician once upon a time.\p"
    .string "But I dreamt of becoming a ninja,\n"
    .string "so I joined this Gym.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KirkDefeat::
    .string "I'm done for!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_KirkPostBattle::
    .string "Even though I've lost, I will keep\n"
    .string "training according to the teachings\l"
    .string "of Koga, my ninja master.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_NateIntro::
    .string "Let's see you beat my special\n"
    .string "techniques!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_NateDefeat::
    .string "You had me fooled!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_NatePostBattle::
    .string "I like poison and sleep techniques,\n"
    .string "as they linger after battle!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_PhilIntro::
    .string "Stop right there!\p"
    .string "The famed invisible walls of\n"
    .string "Fuchsia Gym have you frustrated?$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_PhilDefeat::
    .string "Whoa!\n"
    .string "You've got it!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_PhilPostBattle::
    .string "You impressed me!\n"
    .string "Here's a hint!\p"
    .string "Look very closely for gaps in the\n"
    .string "invisible walls!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_EdgarIntro::
    .string "I also study the way of the ninja\n"
    .string "with Master Koga!\p"
    .string "Ninja have a long history of using\n"
    .string "animals!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_EdgarDefeat::
    .string "Awoo!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_EdgarPostBattle::
    .string "I still have much to learn.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_ShawnIntro::
    .string "Master Koga comes from a long line\n"
    .string "of ninjas.\p"
    .string "What did you descend from?$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_ShawnDefeat::
    .string "You're more skilled than I'd\n"
    .string "thought!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_ShawnPostBattle::
    .string "Where there is light, there is\n"
    .string "shadow!\p"
    .string "Light and shadow!\n"
    .string "Which do you choose?$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice::
    .string "Yo!\n"
    .string "Champ in the making!\p"
    .string "Fuchsia Gym is a tricked-up place.\n"
    .string "It's riddled with invisible walls!\p"
    .string "Koga might appear close, but he's\n"
    .string "blocked off.\p"
    .string "You have to find gaps in the walls\n"
    .string "to reach him.$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory::
    .string "It's amazing how ninja can terrify,\n"
    .string "even now!$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "Fuchsia Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Koga\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}$"

FuchsiaCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon::
    .string "Fuchsia Pokémon Gym\n"
    .string "Leader: Koga\p"
    .string "Winning Trainers:\n"
    .string "{RIVAL}, {PLAYER}$"

